            "additional_class": ""
          },
          "blocks": {
            "acc_082": {
              "type": "_accordion",
              "settings": {
                "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                "heading": "Quels cafés puis-je utiliser ?",
                "heading_tag": "p",
                "heading_style": "paragraph",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "icon_custom": "",
                "additional_class": ""
              },
              "blocks": {
                "t_081": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:text",
                  "settings": {
                    "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                    "text": "<p>La machine accepte le café moulu ainsi que les capsules Nespresso Original et les petites capsules Dolce Gusto. Vous gardez la liberté de choisir selon votre humeur du moment, entre la rapidité d'une capsule et le plaisir d'un café fraîchement moulu.</p>",
                    "text_style": "paragraph",
                    "paragraph_font_size": "normal",
                    "font_weight": 400,
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "alignment_mobile": "left",
                    "show_read_more": false,
                    "read_more_length": 200,
                    "read_more_text": "Voir plus",
                    "read_less_text": "Voir moins",
                    "truncate": false,
                    "truncate_length": 2,
                    "margin_top": 0,
                    "margin_bottom": 0,
                    "additional_class": ""
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "t_081"
              ]
            },
            "acc_084": {
              "type": "_accordion",
              "settings": {
                "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                "heading": "Combien de temps pour un expresso ?",
                "heading_tag": "p",
                "heading_style": "paragraph",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "icon_custom": "",
                "additional_class": ""
              },
              "blocks": {
                "t_083": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:text",
                  "settings": {
                    "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                    "text": "<p>Vous versez de l'eau froide, double-cliquez, et la machine chauffe seule à 92 °C en environ 5 à 6 minutes. L'extraction sous 20 bars démarre ensuite automatiquement. Aucune eau chaude à préparer à l'avance.</p>",
                    "text_style": "paragraph",
                    "paragraph_font_size": "normal",
                    "font_weight": 400,
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "alignment_mobile": "left",
                    "show_read_more": false,
                    "read_more_length": 200,
                    "read_more_text": "Voir plus",
                    "read_less_text": "Voir moins",
                    "truncate": false,
                    "truncate_length": 2,
                    "margin_top": 0,
                    "margin_bottom": 0,
                    "additional_class": ""
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "t_083"
              ]
            },
            "acc_086": {
              "type": "_accordion",
              "settings": {
                "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                "heading": "Comment se recharge la machine ?",
                "heading_tag": "p",
                "heading_style": "paragraph",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "icon_custom": "",
                "additional_class": ""
              },
              "blocks": {
                "t_085": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:text",
                  "settings": {
                    "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                    "text": "<p>Elle se recharge en USB-C, exactement comme un smartphone récent. Branchez-la sur un ordinateur, une batterie externe, un chargeur secteur ou la prise USB d'une voiture. Plus besoin de prise dédiée.</p>",
                    "text_style": "paragraph",
                    "paragraph_font_size": "normal",
                    "font_weight": 400,
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "alignment_mobile": "left",
                    "show_read_more": false,
                    "read_more_length": 200,
                    "read_more_text": "Voir plus",
                    "read_less_text": "Voir moins",
                    "truncate": false,
                    "truncate_length": 2,
                    "margin_top": 0,
                    "margin_bottom": 0,
                    "additional_class": ""
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "t_085"
              ]
            },
            "acc_088": {
              "type": "_accordion",
              "settings": {
                "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                "heading": "L'entretien est-il compliqué ?",
                "heading_tag": "p",
                "heading_style": "paragraph",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "icon_custom": "",
                "additional_class": ""
              },
              "blocks": {
                "t_087": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:text",
                  "settings": {
                    "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                    "text": "<p>Un rinçage du porte-filtre après chaque utilisation et un détartrage occasionnel suffisent. Les pièces en contact avec le café se nettoient en quelques secondes sous l'eau claire.</p>",
                    "text_style": "paragraph",
                    "paragraph_font_size": "normal",
                    "font_weight": 400,
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "alignment_mobile": "left",
                    "show_read_more": false,
